      {
        "name": "Ask for steps to reproduce",
        "nickname": "Needs repro",
        "appliesTo": "issue",
        "body": "Thanks for reporting this, @{{.Author}}. Could you add the steps to reproduce it, what you expected to happen, and what happened instead, with the version you saw it in? That will help get it fixed.\n",
